{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make bonds beyond the stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/800ae5ac1bbdb59885452b33cb9e65ef.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/800ae5ac1bbdb59885452b33cb9e65ef.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/800ae5ac1bbdb59885452b33cb9e65ef.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet the outcasts and misfits that make Kent University\u2019s theater club their home. After each rehearsal you\u2019ll get to manage your time, there are different activities that may raise your affinity with specific characters or increase your social stats (Maturity, Honesty, Comradery).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow alongside these characters as you uncover their stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/6c382a268d16c07d5ced66fea2319052.avif?t=1774876587\" width=583 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ad00ebec919ec1b0bfe261ff4696ff3b.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ad00ebec919ec1b0bfe261ff4696ff3b.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ad00ebec919ec1b0bfe261ff4696ff3b.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/da6375a1eca7e53a2981acaf247bc790.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/da6375a1eca7e53a2981acaf247bc790.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/da6375a1eca7e53a2981acaf247bc790.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you bond close enough to someone, mere friendship might blossom into something else...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ready your blades! Drama awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/79cb13117a9555e71001bc83c1c84e39.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/79cb13117a9555e71001bc83c1c84e39.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/79cb13117a9555e71001bc83c1c84e39.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each of the game\u2019s chapter will have you re-in-act a pivotal battle in the play\u2019s story of the fight between the royal houses of York and Lancaster! It\u2019s up to you which actor is cast as each role and the story and dialogues might change accordingly!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/0990ff72f7ffb5f61b380ca67c6c7027.avif?t=1774876587\" width=583 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/d12477d27825e66669562100644eaffa.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/d12477d27825e66669562100644eaffa.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/d12477d27825e66669562100644eaffa.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each unit type has their own strengths and weaknesses we\u2019ve got a diverse casting from SRPG staples to bizarre ideas that work surprisingly well as SRPG classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ac0eefd9ca031edeec237bfaf5f8afb8.poster.avif?t=1774876587\" width=1030 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ac0eefd9ca031edeec237bfaf5f8afb8.webm?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134390/extras/ac0eefd9ca031edeec237bfaf5f8afb8.mp4?t=1774876587\" type=\"video/m